Linux:
fyrst:
cd ~/.../Project5/Part2/userspace_app
    compile:
mkdir -p deb/usr/local/bin
zig c++ -target arm-linux-gnueabihf \
build/src/main.cpp \
build/src/drive.cpp \
build/src/P_controller.cpp \
build/src/PI_controller.cpp \
-Ibuild/include \
-L./lib -lgpiod \
-o deb/usr/local/bin/project5
dpkg-deb --build deb project5.deb
    senda á pi: 
scp project5.deb username@ip:~/username



Á raspberry pi:
    sudo apt install ~/project5.deb

keyrir í terminal með "project5 100.0"
